  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: FINAL EXPENDITURE VERIFICATION OF AFIKEPO MULTI-ANNUAL PE (FED/2017/389-416) AND KULIMA MULTI-ANNUAL PE (FED/2018/396-530) - EU support to promotion of nutrition in Malawi. Overall objective is to &apos;enhance nutrition security in Malawi&apos; through increased and diversified dietary intake, nutrition education, good governance for optimal nutrition optimal nutrition for women of child bearing age, adolescent girls, infants and young children</narrative>
  </description>
